WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:09.508
Open Tímabókanir
from the Spoi menu.

2
00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:14.509
The faculty's courses take
a moment to load.

3
00:00:14.609 --> 00:00:19.512
The top row explains the colours
used on the calendar…

4
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:24.514
…and its checkboxes filter
the list of courses.

5
00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:29.515
Tick “Tími án bókunar”
(session without booking).

6
00:00:29.615 --> 00:00:35.517
The search box shows how many
courses have unbooked sessions.

7
00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:39.519
The list now offers
only those courses.

8
00:00:39.619 --> 00:00:44.521
Tick several to get courses
with any of them.

9
00:00:44.621 --> 00:00:49.523
Green has no filter –
booked is how it should be.

10
00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:55.366
Untick, and search by
course number or name.

11
00:00:55.466 --> 00:01:01.367
One typical week with all its sessions;
clash pills follow shortly.

12
00:01:06.471 --> 00:01:12.372
Click a session: its Bókun (booking)
and Stillingar (settings) appear.

13
00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:18.374
Further down: settings and teachers
for the whole course.

14
00:01:18.474 --> 00:01:23.377
Everything for one course
is on this one scrolling page.

15
00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:29.379
Sýna vikur (show weeks): sessions
outside the chosen weeks fade.

16
00:01:29.479 --> 00:01:34.381
Nothing is saved as you go –
changes wait here.

17
00:01:34.481 --> 00:01:40.372
“1 óvistuð breyting”
= 1 unsaved change.

18
00:01:40.472 --> 00:01:45.373
Núllstilla (reset) undoes
everything not yet saved.

19
00:01:45.473 --> 00:01:51.374
Staðfesta og vista (confirm and save)
writes the changes. Not before.
